** Abaqus material card - Lemon Curry 30D
** Source: tspa-fabric-materials (Zournatzis et al.), uniaxial tests ISO 527-1/-3, n=3 per direction (n=2 for Lemon Curry 30D bias)
** Units: MPa, mm (consistent N-mm-s system)
** Orthotropic in-plane (membrane/shell) model; direction 1 = warp, 2 = weft
** E1 = 423.6 MPa (warp, measured), E2 = 248.1 MPa (weft), E45 = 73.8 MPa (bias, measured)
** nu12 = 0.3 (ASSUMED, not measured)
** G12 derived from the bias modulus: 1/G12 = 4/E45 - 1/E1 - 1/E2 + 2*nu12/E1  (depends on assumed nu12)
** G13 = G23 = G12 (ASSUMED; transverse shear irrelevant for membrane models)
** Linear-elastic response observed up to near failure. Strength (MPa): warp 50.0, weft 32.7, bias 49.9
** Nominal thickness: not measured
*MATERIAL, NAME=LEMON_CURRY_30D
*ELASTIC, TYPE=LAMINA
